This license covers the repository tooling (tools/, docs/, the generated hub
and benchmark). Each game under games/ keeps its own license, declared in the
"licenca" field of its meta.json and, where present, in a LICENSE file inside
the game's own folder. Copyright in each game stays with its author.

Esta licenca cobre a infraestrutura do repositorio (tools/, docs/, o hub e o
benchmark gerados). Cada jogo em games/ tem a licenca dele, declarada no campo
"licenca" do meta.json e, quando houver, num LICENSE dentro da pasta do jogo.
O direito autoral de cada jogo e de quem o fez.
